        "text": {
            "description_html": "<P><b>Fusion AP-F3, Pistol Lever with Traditonal Round Rose</b></P>\r\n<p>The unique beauty of this Fusion made leverset is timeless. The Pistol Lever with the Cambridge Rose, can be transformed from the old world to the new with the selection of  one of the 4 available finishes. Made out of solid brass, it is backed by a lifetime warranty. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thickness from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Fusion AP-F3 Pistol Lever and Cambridge Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<LI>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</LI>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Specifications</B> for Traditional Door Lever Fusion AP F3:\r\n<UL>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<LI>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</LI>\r\n<LI>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</LI>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><B>When Selecting a Function:</B><ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy Set: Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul></p>",
